  - name: Tutorial
    portrait: {fileID: 10907, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
    sentences:
    - 'Combat is turnbased.

      Select each character and choose their actions...'
    - ...then press the Ready button to execute your turn.
    - "Choose selected characters' actions by:\n \u2022 left clicking on the ground
      to move,\n \u2022 left clicking on an enemy to attack."
    - Characters can only do so much each turn!
